OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1787055506
OL,3,CDrug Dealer Jailed After Trying to
OL,4,CDiscard Cocaine Under Parked Car
OL,6,FWATCH: The moment Kent Police arrest
OL,7,FDean Smith after witnessing him trying
OL,8,Fto discard his cocaine
OL,10,FA drug dealer who tried to discard his
OL,11,Fcocaine moments before being arrested
OL,12,Fhas been sentenced to three years in
OL,13,Fprison following a targeted police
OL,14,Finvestigation in Kent.
OL,16,FDean Smith, 51, of The Cockpit in
OL,17,FMarden, was jailed at Maidstone Crown
OL,18,FCourt after pleading guilty to
OL,19,Fpossession with intent to supply Class
OL,20,FA drugs.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/5
