OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1787055506
OL,3,CDrug Dealer Jailed After Trying to
OL,4,CDiscard Cocaine Under Parked Car
OL,6,FKent Police launched an investigation
OL,7,Fafter receiving multiple reports of
OL,8,Fsuspicious activity at an address in
OL,9,FThe Cockpit, where residents spotted
OL,10,Fpeople entering a communal garden and
OL,11,Fleaving carrying packages.
OL,13,FOfficers carried out initial enquiries
OL,14,Fand identified Smith as the resident.
OL,15,FContinuous monitoring of the property
OL,16,Fled to a search warrant being executed
OL,17,Fon Thursday 1 May.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/5
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1787055506
OL,3,CDrug Dealer Jailed After Trying to
OL,4,CDiscard Cocaine Under Parked Car
OL,6,FAs patrols arrived at the scene, a
OL,7,FPCSO spotted Smith getting out of a
OL,8,Fvehicle and throwing a package under a
OL,9,Fnearby parked car.
OL,11,FAfter recovering the item, and
OL,12,Fconfirming it contained cocaine, Smith
OL,13,Fwas arrested and taken into custody.
OL,15,FSpeaking after the sentencing,
OL,16,Finvestigating officer PC John Cockrill
OL,17,Fsaid: "This was a dedicated
OL,18,Finvestigation which allowed officers
OL,19,Fto secure enough evidence to ensure
OL,20,FSmith had no choice but to plead
OL,21,Fguilty to the offence.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/5
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1787055506
OL,3,CDrug Dealer Jailed After Trying to
OL,4,CDiscard Cocaine Under Parked Car
OL,6,F"Even as officers went to arrest
OL,7,FSmith, he was caught red-handed trying
OL,8,Fto discard his drugs, further
OL,9,Fstrengthening the case we had against
OL,10,Fhim."
OL,12,FPC Cockrill also praised the local
OL,13,Fcommunity for reporting the suspicious
OL,14,Fbehavior: "Drug dealing has such a
OL,15,Fdetrimental impact on a community, and
OL,16,Fwe'd like to thank the local people
OL,17,Fwho assisted us to bring this criminal
OL,18,Fto justice.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/5
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
