CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1787055506
OL,3,CDrug Dealer Jailed After Trying to
OL,4,CDiscard Cocaine Under Parked Car
OL,6,F"I would encourage anyone who spots
OL,7,Fsuspicious activity to report it to us
OL,8,Fonline or via their neighbourhood
OL,9,Fofficer. Your information could be
OL,10,Fvital and assist us to remove an
OL,11,Fongoing problem."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/5
